:"Your bank balance is tiny, but your ambitions are big. <br><br>With a little help from your uncle, you get an apartment and your first job. But then it's up to you to achieve success and take over New York City any way you like. <br><br>Slowly build multiple small businesses, grow them into huge corporations, or carve your own unique path \u2013 the possibilities are limitless in this vast business sandbox. You've never played anything like this!<br><br>Go from a small apartment and public transport to luxury suites, fast cars and designer furniture. Put your money into investment funds and real estate. Succeed, fail, rebuild. But remember to take care of yourself, sleep and stay happy on your rise to the top. <br><br>Do you have what it takes to build your own empire?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331550/extras/f410b4f8b58657d2dabab97744f6c4fd.webp?t=1775198159\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br>Go from nothing to the most prominent tycoon in New York. Start a business, work smart, make it thrive and enjoy your life. How do you want to be successful? How far can you push it? How long can you make it last?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331550/extras/9b7102116960623777fe0998e9d765c4.poster.avif?t=1775198159\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331550/extras/9b7102116960623777fe0998e9d765c4.webm?t=1775198159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331550/extras/9b7102116960623777fe0998e9d765c4.mp4?t=1775198159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331550/extras/ca5